{"seq":43,"slug":"software-estimation-planning","title":"软件估算与计划","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning","rating":{"composite":3.98,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"软件估算与计划-简介\">软件估算与计划 简介</h1><p>软件项目中最具破坏力的谎言不是技术债务，而是那句&quot;大概两周能做完&quot;。Standish Group 对五万多个 IT 项目的统计显示只有 29% 按时按预算交付，McKinsey 与牛津大学联合研究发现大型 IT 项目平均超支 45%、超期 7%，且交付价值比预期低 56%。这些数字的背后是一个系统性问题：我们在用确定性思维应对本质上不确定的知识工作。</p>\n<p>本知识库聚焦一个特定问题——<strong>何时能做完、需要多少资源</strong>。它不讨论如何执行项目（那是项目管理的范畴），也不讨论如何设定和追踪目标（那是目标执行系统的领域）。它只回答：面对不确定性时，如何做出诚实、有用、可校准的预测，以及如何围绕这些预测构建务实的计划。</p>\n<p>全书从认知科学到数学模型，从团队实践到组织文化，构建了一套完整的估算与计划体系：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>估算基础</strong>建立认知框架——估算的本质是什么、有哪些经典技术、如何对不确定性建模。这些概念贯穿后续所有内容。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>现代估算方法</strong>深入三种当代最具影响力的方法论：故事点与相对估算、蒙特卡洛预测、参考类预测。它们代表了从主观判断到数据驱动的演进方向。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>计划编制</strong>将估算转化为可执行的计划，涵盖路线图与里程碑设计、缓冲管理策略，以及在约束条件下进行范围协商的技巧。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>执行中的校准</strong>关注估算在落地过程中如何保持准确——速率与吞吐量度量、何时触发重新估算，以及如何在组织中建立健康的估算文化。</p>\n<p>建议从第一章顺序阅读，认知偏误和不确定性模型是理解后续方法论的前提。如果你的团队已有估算实践但效果不佳，可从第四章的诊断框架切入。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"估算基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"estimation-principles","title":"估算原则与认知偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations/estimation-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"estimation-techniques","title":"估算技术体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations/estimation-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"uncertainty-modeling","title":"不确定性建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations/uncertainty-modeling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methods","title":"现代估算方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"story-points-relative","title":"故事点与相对估算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods/story-points-relative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-forecasting","title":"蒙特卡洛交付预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods/monte-carlo-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reference-class-forecasting","title":"参考类预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods/reference-class-forecasting"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"planning","title":"计划编制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/planning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"roadmap-milestone","title":"路线图与里程碑设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/planning/roadmap-milestone"},{"seq":2,"slug":"buffer-management","title":"缓冲管理策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/planning/buffer-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scope-negotiation","title":"范围协商与约束管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/planning/scope-negotiation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"execution","title":"执行中的校准","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"velocity-throughput","title":"速率与吞吐量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/execution/velocity-throughput"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reestimation-triggers","title":"重新估算触发器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/execution/reestimation-triggers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"estimation-culture","title":"估算文化建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/execution/estimation-culture"}]}]}